${BOLD}Primary Commands:${NC}
  ${GREEN}start${NC}, ${GREEN}up${NC}              Start Dokploy core services and Traefik proxy
  ${YELLOW}stop${NC}, ${YELLOW}down${NC}             Stop Dokploy services and user applications
  ${CYAN}restart${NC}              Restart Dokploy services
  ${BLUE}status${NC}, ${BLUE}ps${NC}             Show real-time status of Dokploy core & apps
  ${MAGENTA}logs${NC}, ${MAGENTA}log${NC} [target]     Inspect container or service logs (panel, db, traefik)
